  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medicines Transparency Alliance (MeTA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medicines procurement, pricing, distribution and other policies and practices are changed on the basis of a multi-stakeholder review of robust evidenceTo improve access to medicines by providing medicines stakeholders with guidance on medicines procurement, pricing, distribution and other policies and practices. This will deliver efficiency savings of 5-10% per annum, in public expenditure on medicines, estimated to be &#xa3;18m to &#xa3;36m across the 7 pilot countries. We estimate that access to medicines could increase by up to 105 in participating countries over 4 years. This contributes to our MDG 8 target 17 to provide access to affordable essential drugs in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
